{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
 "name": "cdeps_templates",
 "description": "Expression-template library for the CDEPS DATM data-atmosphere component (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the pointwise forcing-derivation laws of the CLMNCEP datamode (datm/datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90, cdeps1.0.112) and of the stream time interpolation (streams/dshr_strdata_mod.F90, streams/dshr_tinterp_mod.F90), transcribed exactly for use by the stage-2 DATM component (cdeps_datm_gswp3.esm). The library carries (a) the saturation vapor pressure esat of datm_eSat (clmncep F90:545-586): the water a0..a6 and ice b0..b6 polynomials evaluated by Horner's rule in degrees C on t = clamp(tK - TKFRZ, -50, 50), phase selected by tKbot < TKFRZ (ice) vs >= (water), result in hPa x100 = Pa; (b) the saturation specific humidity qsat = eps e / (pbot - eps1 e) (F90:410,415,422) with eps = 0.622 and eps1 = 1 - eps = 0.378 (the molecular-weight-ratio pair of water vapor to dry air); (c) the vapor pressure vp = q pbot / (eps + eps1 q) and air density rho = (pbot - eps1 vp) / (tbot RDAIR) with RDAIR = 287.0423113650487 (F90:428-429, SHR_CONST_RDAIR = AVOGAD*BOLTZ/MWDAIR); (d) the shortwave direct/diffuse ratios ratio_rvrf of the cam3_5_55-based polynomials (F90:450-456): NIR 0.29548 + 0.00504 s - 1.4957e-5 s^2 + 1.4881e-8 s^3 and VIS 0.17639 + 0.00380 s - 9.0039e-6 s^2 + 8.1351e-9 s^3, both clamped to [0.01, 0.99], where s is the half shortwave (s = swdn/2 = swndr = swvdr); (e) the rain/snow ramp fraction frac = clamp((T - TKFRZ)*0.5, 0, 1) of shr_precip_partition_rain_snow_ramp (share/shr_precip_mod.F90:17-45); and (f) the horizontal wind split u = v = wind/sqrt(2) (F90:402-403). The shared constants are factored as zero-parameter fragments: tkfrz = 273.15 K (the TKFRZ of the esat phase branch and the rain/snow ramp) and the molecular-weight-ratio pair eps = 0.622, eps1 = 1 - eps = 0.378 of the qsat/vapor-pressure/density laws; the polynomial coefficients and the ramp slope stay as literals. All laws are pointwise; the stage-2 DATM model applies them per mesh point with stream values (LB/UB + interpolation factors at the streams layer; interpolated values at the datamode layer) from the GSWP3v1 data_sources, and the tests pin them to the stage-1 instrumentation dumps (stage1/dumps/cdeps/cdeps_strdata_streams.csv, datm_gswp3_streams.csv, datm_gswp3_exports.csv).",
 "tags": [
  "data_models",
  "cdeps",
  "datm",
  "data-atmosphere",
  "expression-templates",
  "cesm"
 ],
 "created": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z",
 "authors": [
  "EqESM project contributors"
 ],
 "references": [
  {
   "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CDEPS: Common Data model EXchange Platform source (cdeps1.0.112) - datm/datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90, streams/dshr_strdata_mod.F90, streams/dshr_tinterp_mod.F90, share/shr_precip_mod.F90, share/shr_const_mod.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
   "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CDEPS"
  },
  {
   "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
   "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
  }
 ]
},
 "expression_templates": {
  "esat_poly_water": {
   "description": "Saturation vapor pressure over water, a0..a6 polynomial of datm_eSat (datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90:553-560, 585-586) evaluated by Horner's rule: e = a0 + t (a1 + t (a2 + t (a3 + t (a4 + t (a5 + t a6))))), t in degrees C (the caller clamps to [-50, 50] and selects the phase), result in hPa (multiply by 100 for Pa).",
   "params": [
    "t"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "const",
      "args": [],
      "value": 6.107799961,
      "units": "Pa"
     },
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "t",
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 0.4436518521,
          "units": "Pa/K"
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "t",
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": 0.01428945805,
              "units": "Pa/K^2"
             },
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               "t",
               {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 0.0002650648471,
                  "units": "Pa/K^3"
                 },
                 {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                   "t",
                   {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                     {
                      "op": "const",
                      "args": [],
                      "value": 3.031240396e-06,
                      "units": "Pa/K^4"
                     },
                     {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                       "t",
                       {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                         {
                          "op": "const",
                          "args": [],
                          "value": 2.034080948e-08,
                          "units": "Pa/K^5"
                         },
                         {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                           "t",
                           {
                            "op": "const",
                            "args": [],
                            "value": 6.136820929e-11,
                            "units": "Pa/K^6"
                           }
                          ]
                         }
                        ]
                       }
                      ]
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "esat_poly_ice": {
   "description": "Saturation vapor pressure over ice, b0..b6 polynomial of datm_eSat (datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90:562-569, 582-583) evaluated by Horner's rule: e = b0 + t (b1 + t (b2 + t (b3 + t (b4 + t (b5 + t b6))))), t in degrees C (the caller clamps to [-50, 50] and selects the phase), result in hPa (multiply by 100 for Pa).",
   "params": [
    "t"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
